# Source: the bennett-plugin-measure worktree's .tmp/suite-measure/REPORT.md
# and its results.jsonl, measured on this 12-core host, 2026-11-08.
# Each command guard is >= 10x its maximum over A/B and LLVM 18/23, rounded
# up to whole seconds with a 60 s floor. The suite guard is 10x the larger
# serial suite measurement (265.447415 s), rounded up; this conservatively
# exceeds 10x the report's parallel-major estimate (156.161 s).
